
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Business | Katsuichi Shoten</title>
    
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+JP:wght@200;400;500&family=Playfair+Display:ital@1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <link href="https://unpkg.com/aos@2.3.1/dist/aos.css" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --color-bg: #0a0a0a;
            --color-text: #ffffff;
            --color-accent: #bfa071;
            --font-serif: 'Noto Serif JP', serif;
            --font-eng: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            --header-height: 90px;
            --header-height-sp: 70px;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0; padding: 0;
            background-color: var(--color-bg);
            color: var(--color-text);
            font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        body.nav-open { overflow: hidden; }

        body::before {
            content: "";
            position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background-image: url('https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/stardust.pattern');
            opacity: 0.12; pointer-events: none; z-index: 9999;
        }

        /* --- Header --- */
        header {
            display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
            padding: 0 60px; position: fixed; top: 0; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box;
            z-index: 2000;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.9);
            height: var(--header-height);
        }

        .logo-image {
            height: 45px; width: auto; display: block;
        }

        /* --- Language Switch --- */
        .lang-switch {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-left: 35px;
            font-family: var(--font-eng);
        }
        .lang-btn {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            opacity: 0.4;
            transition: 0.3s;
            letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        }
        .lang-btn.active { opacity: 1; pointer-events: none; }
        .lang-btn:hover { opacity: 1; color: var(--color-accent); }
        .lang-divider { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); font-size: 0.6rem; }

        /* --- Navigation --- */
        .nav-pc { display: flex; align-items: center; }
        .nav-pc ul { list-style: none; display: flex; gap: 35px; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        .nav-pc ul li a { 
            text-decoration: none; color: #fff; font-size: 0.75rem; 
            letter-spacing: 0.15em; transition: 0.5s; opacity: 0.75; 
        }
        .nav-pc ul li a:hover { opacity: 1; color: var(--color-accent); }

        .menu-trigger {
            display: none;
            width: 30px; height: 24px; position: relative; z-index: 3000;
            background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer;
        }
        .menu-trigger span {
            position: absolute; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 1px;
            background-color: #fff; transition: all 0.4s;
        }
        .menu-trigger span:nth-of-type(1) { top: 0; }
        .menu-trigger span:nth-of-type(2) { top: 11px; }
        .menu-trigger span:nth-of-type(3) { bottom: 0; }
        .menu-trigger.active span:nth-of-type(1) { transform: translateY(11px) rotate(-45deg); }
        .menu-trigger.active span:nth-of-type(2) { opacity: 0; }
        .menu-trigger.active span:nth-of-type(3) { transform: translateY(-12px) rotate(45deg); }

        .nav-sp {
            position: fixed; top: 0; right: -100%; width: 100%; height: 100vh;
            background: rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.98); z-index: 2500;
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center;
            transition: all 0.5s; visibility: hidden;
        }
        .nav-sp.active { right: 0; visibility: visible; }
        .nav-sp ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; text-align: center; }
        .nav-sp ul li { margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .nav-sp ul li a { color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-size: 1.2rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; }

        /* --- Content Page Styling --- */
        .page-header {
            padding-top: 180px;
            padding-bottom: 100px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .page-title-en {
            font-family: var(--font-eng);
            font-size: 3rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            color: var(--color-accent);
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .page-title-jp {
            font-family: var(--font-serif);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.5em;
            opacity: 0.6;
        }

        .business-section {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto 150px;
            padding: 0 40px;
        }
        .business-item {
            display: flex;
            gap: 60px;
            margin-bottom: 120px;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .business-item:nth-child(even) { flex-direction: row-reverse; }
        
        .business-img { flex: 1; }
        .business-img img { width: 100%; height: auto; filter: grayscale(30%); }
        
        .business-text { flex: 1; }
        .business-text h3 {
            font-family: var(--font-serif);
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            color: var(--color-accent);
        }
        .business-text p {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #ccc;
            line-height: 2;
        }

        footer { padding: 60px; text-align: center; font-size: 0.65rem; color: #444; letter-spacing: 0.2em; background: #000; }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            header { padding: 0 25px; height: var(--header-height-sp); }
            .nav-pc { display: none; }
            .menu-trigger { display: block; }
            .business-item, .business-item:nth-child(even) { flex-direction: column; gap: 30px; }
            .page-title-en { font-size: 2.2rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <a href="index.html">
        <img src="../看板_540×450mm_1_out_1-01.png" alt="Katsuichi Shoten" class="logo-image">
    </a>
    
    <nav class="nav-pc">
        <ul>
            <li><a href="index.html">HOME</a></li>
            <li><a href="business.html">BUSINESS</a></li>
            <li><a href="works.html">WORKS</a></li>
            <li><a href="about.html">ABOUT</a></li>
            <li><a href="contact.html">CONTACT</a></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="lang-switch">
            <a href="../business.html" class="lang-btn">JP</a>
            <span class="lang-divider">/</span>
            <span class="lang-btn active">EN</span>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <button class="menu-trigger" id="js-hamburger">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </button>
</header>

<nav class="nav-sp" id="js-nav-sp">
    <ul>
        <li><a href="index.html">HOME</a></li>
        <li><a href="business.html">BUSINESS</a></li>
        <li><a href="works.html">WORKS</a></li>
        <li><a href="about.html">ABOUT</a></li>
        <li><a href="contact.html">CONTACT</a></li>
        <li style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <div class="lang-switch" style="justify-content: center;">
                <a href="../business.html" class="lang-btn" style="font-size: 1rem;">JP</a>
                <span class="lang-divider">/</span>
                <span class="lang-btn active" style="font-size: 1rem;">EN</span>
            </div>
        </li>
    </ul>
</nav>

<main>
    <div class="page-header" data-aos="fade-down">
        <span class="page-title-en">BUSINESS</span>
        <span class="page-title-jp">事業内容</span>
    </div>

    <section class="business-section">
        <div class="business-item" data-aos="fade-up">
            <div class="business-img">
                <img src="../IMG_0538.jpg" alt="Renovation">
            </div>
            <div class="business-text">
                <h3>Renovation & Interior</h3>
                <p>We revitalize old buildings by blending traditional Hokkaido woodcraft with modern design. Our goal is to create spaces that honor the passage of time while providing contemporary comfort.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="business-item" data-aos="fade-up">
            <div class="business-img">
                <img src="../IMG_5250.JPG" alt="Wood Craft">
            </div>
            <div class="business-text">
                <h3>Woodwork & Furniture</h3>
                <p>Utilizing high-quality timber from local forests, we craft custom furniture and architectural elements. Every piece is designed to highlight the unique narrative found within the wood's grain.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</main>

<footer>&copy; Katsuichi Shoten Co., Ltd.</footer>

<script src="https://unpkg.com/aos@2.3.1/dist/aos.js"></script>
<script>
    AOS.init({ duration: 1200, once: true });

    const hamburger = document.getElementById('js-hamburger');
    const navSp = document.getElementById('js-nav-sp');
    hamburger.addEventListener('click', () => {
        hamburger.classList.toggle('active');
        navSp.classList.toggle('active');
    });
</script>
</body>
</html>
